# Terraform

- Root: `terraform/platform/` (workspaces `dev` / `prod`, state in Terraform Cloud).
- Shared VPS module: `terraform/modules/server/`.
- Vars / locals / outputs in the platform root. New server types add another root beside `platform/` composing the same module.
